WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.525
Make a table

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.400
A table for the songs. Type its name, then plus.

3
00:00:06.051 --> 00:00:08.676
Click a field to rename it. Title.

4
00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:15.982
Plus adds a field. Artist, then length.

5
00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.504
Length holds numbers, so choose Number.

6
00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:30.095
Plus row, then type one song along the row.
